  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The v2.2 installer throws a null pointer exception when doing a custom install.  The (main) custom options are:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Existing Tomcat (ports 8080/8005)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Database: included",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "No SSL.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The (partial) trace is:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "at fedora.utilities.install.container.TomcatServerXML.setShutdownPort(TomcatServerXML.java:45)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at fedora.utilities.install.container.TomcatServerXML.update(TomcatServerXML.java:32)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at fedora.utilities.install.container.ExistingTomcat.installServerXML(ExistingTomcat.java:32)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at fedora.utilities.install.container.Tomcat.install(Tomcat.java:43)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at fedora.utilities.install.container.ExistingTomcat50.install(ExistingTomcat50.java:15)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at fedora.utilities.install.Installer.install(Installer.java:66)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at fedora.utilities.install.Installer.main(Installer.java:227)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The line numbers do not match the source download, but it appears that the element search for \"/Server[@shuddown and @port]\" is returning null leading to the failure.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The ONLY successful install I've manages with 2.2 is a \"quick\" install.  Any attempt at a custom install lead to errors.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
