     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: chernich<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=1795155<br/>\nOriginator: YES</p>\n\n<p>Problem found and solved.<br/>\nThe installed Tomcat5 had a cut-down server.xml file; the attributes specified in the Xpath statement were absent, hence the null pointer.  A null check after the path search might be nice...</p>",
