     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: pangloss<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=487398<br/>\nOriginator: NO</p>\n\n<p>TomcatServerXML now throws an InstallationFailedException if the XPath query returns null.</p>\n\n<p>Also started on a JUnit test case (src/test/junit/fedora/utilities/install/container/TestTomcatServerXML.java), but this could use some fleshing out.</p>\n\n<p>Fixed in dev-145635 r6525 (2.2.x) and dev-145636 r6526 (3.0b1). Leaving this open until merged into trunk and maintenance-2.2.</p>\n\n<p>Thanks for the bug report!</p>",
